ocs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"},"830":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-19","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"831":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-20","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"832":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-21","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#default","content":"Minimal usage with a `Label`, min/max, and stepper `Button`s."},"833":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-22","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#controlled","content":"Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state."},"834":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-23","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#invalid","content":"Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` for validation feedback."},"835":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-24","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#disabled","content":"Use `isDisabled` to prevent input."},"836":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-25","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#hide-stepper","content":"Compose without stepper `Button`s for a plain numeric input."},"837":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-26","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#value-scale","content":"Use `minValue`, `maxValue`, and `step` to set the allowed values. Steps are calculated from the minimum value."},"838":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-27","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#format-options-numbering-system","content":"By default, NumberField displays the value using the numbering system for the user's locale. Use the `formatOptions` prop to override the numbering system by setting the Unicode numbering system locale extension."},"839":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-28","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#sizes","content":"`size` sets the label, input, and steppers. Without it, the field follows the surrounding size\nscope."},"840":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-29","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#text-steppers","content":"Compose with `children` to replace the stepper icons with your own content, such as text."},"841":{"id":"/docs/components/modal","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"page","content":"Modal","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal"},"842":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-0","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal","content":"The Modal component presents a dialog window over the page that focuses the user's attention on a single task or piece of information."},"843":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-1","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal#installation","content":"Installation"},"844":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-2","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal#examples","content":"Examples"},"845":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-3","page_id"